  "details": "From beta [1186] and up the Value slot is missing. Because of the change to have Boolean values, instead of requiring the use of a float for Constant and OnEnter receiver types. You can no longer group many contacts receivers together to save on bits.\nStaying inside the limits, of 16 for quest and 32 for pc. You are required to use two to four times the amount of bits to fill out these limits. Compared to build [1185].\nWould be nice to see an option to choose what type of parameter is being updated.",
